{
  "$comment": [
    "MIG4 — NFC regression trap. The shipped Quran corpus is intentionally NOT in NFC:",
    "5,771 of 6,236 ayahs change under .normalize(\"NFC\"), dominated by canonical reordering of",
    "shadda U+0651 (ccc=33) after a vowel such as fatha U+064E (ccc=30).",
    "",
    "services/asr-inference/server.py:626-632 depends on the raw consonant+shadda+vowel order to",
    "detect ghunnah. Any layer that normalizes -- a JSON library, Postgres normalize(), Swift",
    "Foundation across a Flutter platform channel -- silently stops those detectors firing AND",
    "changes every canonical checksum, with no error anywhere.",
    "",
    "Stored as CODEPOINT ARRAYS, never literal characters. Combining marks are invisible in an",
    "editor and in a diff: that is exactly how the forced_align.py diacritic bug (PR #258) shipped",
    "and survived review.",
    "",
    "These vectors are a TRAP, not a target: the test asserts shipped != NFC. If it ever fails,",
    "something upstream started normalizing and must be found, not accommodated."
  ],
